Mixer is format SDL_AUDIO_S16LE, 2 channels, 44100 frequency
Available decoders:
 - WAV
 - SINEWAVE
 - RAW

alaw8.wav: SDL_AUDIO_F32LE, 1 channel, 8000 freq
alaw8.wav metadata:
 - SDL_mixer.audio.decoder [string="WAV"]
 - SDL_mixer.audio.load.closeio [boolean=true]
 - SDL_mixer.audio.load.path [string="alaw8.wav"]
 - SDL_mixer.audio.load.predecode [boolean=false]
 - SDL_mixer.audio.load.preferred_mixer [pointer=0x512000000940]
 - SDL_mixer.metadata.duration_frames [number=8]

